+# CLAUDE.md
+
+shop-api, a TypeScript service. Team rules live in CONTRIBUTING.md; this file restates them as instructions for agents.
+
+## Money
+
+Store and compute every amount as integer cents, typed `Cents` from `src/money.ts`. `Cents` is a plain alias for `number`, so the compiler will accept a float; keep values whole yourself.
+
+## Migrations
+
+A migration that has shipped is permanent. To change the schema, add a new migration that alters the result of the old one.
+
+## legacy/
+
+`legacy/` is frozen. Change it only for a security fix; build new behaviour outside it.
+
+## Before you push
+
+Run `npm test` and `npm run lint`. CONTRIBUTING only asks for tests, but CI also runs lint and will fail on it.
+
+## Gotchas
+
+- `npm run dev` watches `src/index.ts`, which does not exist yet. Create it before expecting the dev server to start.
+- `legacy/` and the migrations directory are not in the repo yet. The rules above apply once they appear.
